description: Forbid emojis in UI and agent-facing copy
alwaysApply: true
---

# No Emojis Policy

- Never use emoji characters in UI text, labels, tooltips, logs, prompts, docs, or generated copy.
- Prefer icon components (e.g. Lucide) instead of emoji characters for visual cues.
- Keep labels professional and plain text (for example `Active`, `Paused`, `Wake`, `Config`).
- If existing code includes emojis, remove them during edits in touched files.

